\end{figure*}
For epoch~$e_1$ the optimizer produces the vector
$\bm{W}_{e_1}^{\mathrm{LP}}$ shown in Fig. \ref{figure:F12} (right),
which aligns with the price path in the left panel and
delivers a modeled LP fee of
$f_{e_1}^{\mathrm{LP}}\bigl(\varphi_{e_1}^{\mathrm{OPT}}\bigr)
