\end{figure}

Today, the research community contributes to the joint field of {ML} and {IoBNT} networks in various directions.
As indicated in \Cref{fig_trends}, a growing number of works focus on the \ac{PHY} layer of {IoBNT}; other contributions research solutions in the \ac{MAC} and higher layers, as well as dataset generation for training, the explainability of {NN} operation, and bio-compatible means for {NN} deployment.
These ongoing research activities lay the groundwork for numerous new developments, as we unveil in this survey.


