Motion control involves setting target positions \({{\left[ x,y,z \right]}^{T}}\), target velocities \({{\left[ u,v,w \right]}^{T}}\), and target orientations \({[\theta, \phi, \psi]^{T}}\). Camera control allows for viewpoint adjustments, and other controls include starting or stopping the drone’s flight.
