Let $\mathcal{G}$ be a groupoid with a length function $\ell$, and $(\Gz,\RR,\mu)$ be a measure space. Let $P \in \B(L^2(\Gz,\mu))$ be a rank-one projection, and $\nu$ the associated probability measure on $\Gz$. Then the following are equivalent:
\begin{enumerate}
 \item $P \in \CC^*_{\dyn}(\mathcal{G})$;
 \item $P \in \CC^*_{\dyn,\q}(\mathcal{G})$;
