Consequently, Theorem \ref{exhaustion of expansion with radon controlled} and Theorem \ref{thm:Markov structure theorem} recover \cite[Theorem 4.6]{asymptoticexpansionandstrongergodicity} and \cite[Theorem 3.20]{li2022markovianroealgebraicapproachasymptotic}, respectively.

