Throughout this subsection, let $\Gamma$ be a finitely generated group and $\{N_i\}_{i\in \N}$ be a family of nested, finite index normal subgroups of $\Gamma$ with trivial intersection. For each $i \in \N$, denote the quotient map $\pi_i: \Gamma \to \Gamma/N_i$, and $\pi_\infty: \Gamma \to \Gamma$ the identity map.


The associated \emph{HLS groupoid} (after Higson, Lafforgue and Skandalis) $\G$ is defined to be
\[
\G\coloneqq\bigsqcup_{i\in \N \cup \{\infty\}} \{i\}\times X_i, \quad \text{where} \quad X_i=
\begin{cases}
\Gamma/N_i \quad &\text{if}\quad i\in \N;\\
\Gamma \quad &\text{if}\quad i=\infty.
\end{cases}
\]
%where
