In this work, we consider a specific case involving two configurations using a set of parameters that maximize the effect of the different boson-fermion terms in a multi-j situation, with $j=1/2, 3/2, 5/2$. A more comprehensive analysis will be presented in a future publication \cite{Maya2025u}. Specifically, we adopt the following set of boson-fermion parameters,
