\section{Background}\label{Sec: B_M}
\subsection{Large Language Model Inference Basics}
The majority of Large Language Models (LLMs) are built on the decoder-only transformer architecture and are composed of a large stack of decoder blocks \cite{vaswani2017attention,chowdhery2023palm,brown2020language}. 
