\rr{Let us restore the work capacity of the molecule or correct the error with the help of another molecule} (as shown in Fig.~\ref{fig14})

(1) Let's consider that initially, the molecules are on the LHS and RHS of the respective boxes. 

(2) Now consider that some error occurs to the particle in the box $\mathcal{A}_\alpha$. 
