For a more realistic evaluation on piano-form camera scores, we manually annotated 32 full-page piano scores from IMSLP \citep{IMSLP}. 
We ensure there is no overlap with PDMX-Synth and it includes only scans produced before the adoption of modern typesetting software such as MuseScore or Verovio. 
