\begin{proposition}[cf. Proposition 7.2 in \cite{Dog}] \label{prop:coeff_change}
Let $\Gamma$ be a countable group. Let $c \in Z^2(\Gamma, \mathbb Z)$ be a cocycle and consider the central extension arising from it
