Following Ref.~\cite{Wang:2021rhd}, we express the transitions from $A_2$ to $A_i$ in tensor form.
Taking the $A_2\to A_5$ transition as an example, the $t$-channel rescattering amplitude is written as
\begin{align}\label{le}
T(A_5)[i,j,k,l]\,=\, B_{c\overline 3}^qH_{pm}^n\contraction[1mm]{}{P}{_n^pB_q^m\,\cdot\,}{P}P_n^p
\contraction[2mm]{}{B}{_q^m\,\cdot\,P_p^nV_l^q P_j^l\,\cdot\,}{B}B_q^m\,\cdot\,P_p^n
