\subsection{$\Xi_c\to \Sigma K $ system (1)}

The decay amplitude for the $\Xi_{c}^{0}\to \Sigma^+K^-$ mode is $\lambda_1(A_1+A_6)$.
The rescattering amplitudes contribute to the $\Xi_{c}^{0}\to \Sigma^+K^-$ decay include
\begin{align}
