The decay amplitude for the $\Xi_{c}^{0}\to \Sigma^0\overline{K}^0$ mode is $\lambda_1(A_4-A_6)/\sqrt{2}$.
The rescattering amplitudes contribute to the $\Xi_{c}^{0}\to \Sigma^0\overline{K}^0$ decay include
