    Fix $T<\infty$. Let $ (\Omega, \cF, \bF=\pro{\cF}, \Pp)$ be a  complete filtered probability space, with $\cF\supseteq\cF_{T}$. The associated conditional expectation operator is denoted by $\Ep^{\Pp}_{\cG_t}[\cdot]$.   
